### Final commit
\`c8f2b26\` — Twisted Metal: Rust Arena playable browser game with verification evidence, pushed on branch \`opencode/34128924778\`.

### Deployment status
- Public Cloudflare URL serves root (200) and game (200); entrypoint \`./index.html\` verified as the served page.
- Local tmux \`app-server\` on port 3000 also verified (HTTP 200).

### Test status (Playwright + Chrome, public URL, zero page errors)
- Title → vehicle select → countdown → battle (5 AI bots, 11 pickups) → pause/resume (P/Esc) → victory → restart: all pass.
- Combat verified: damage, kill credit, per-vehicle specials, sudden-death stalemate guard terminates and shows results.
- Mobile 390×844 touch layout verified, including a HUD-overlap fix made during validation.

### Known limitations
- Sandbox has no external network, so the Three.js CDN 3D renderer could not render here; the game automatically uses the offline 2D renderer (same rules, verified). 3D chase-cam activates automatically when the CDN is reachable.
- Software-rendered test fps was 17–41; real GPUs will be faster." 2>&1 | head -3
